1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior SaaS product engineer, full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, and product-minded technical lead.

Your task is to build Anchrr, a modern, web-based SaaS platform for content creators, influencers, personal brands, and online businesses.

Do not build merely a landing page, static prototype, or collection of disconnected UI screens. Build a functional, integrated web application with a real frontend, backend, database, authentication, creator dashboard, and public-facing creator pages.

